        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T21:36:55.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T01:14:30.523Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Developers can give a GitHub App the read-only Copilot Requests organization permission, install the app on an organization, and pass a short-lived installation access token to the Copilot SDK.",
